      <div class="nearby-foot">
        <p>Local service providers are joining soon. Parcel delivery is available today.</p>
        <a href="#hero">Send a parcel →</a>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="how" id="how">
      <div class="how-copy">
        <div class="pill"><i></i> Simple from start to finish</div>
        <h2>Booked in minutes. Sorted without the fuss.</h2>
        <p>Ajobzio keeps the useful details up front, so you can make a confident choice quickly.</p>
        <ul class="how-checks">
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10A88B" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg> No sign-up or membership fees</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10A88B" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg> Contact details shared only when you choose</li>
          <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#10A88B" stroke-width="2.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12 5 5L20 7"/></svg> Friendly support if plans change</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="how-cta" href="#hero">Start a search <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg></a>
      </div>
      <ol class="how-steps">
        <li>
          <span class="how-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Tell us what you need</h3>
            <p>Enter two locations and parcel details, or describe the local service you’re looking for.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="how-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg></span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="how-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Compare trusted options</h3>
            <p>See real availability, verified reviews and straightforward prices side by side.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="how-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 6h10M18 6h2M4 12h4M12 12h8M4 18h10M18 18h2"/><circle cx="16" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="10" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="16" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="how-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Choose and get it done</h3>
            <p>Book directly with your provider. Track delivery or agree the job details — no account needed.</p>
          </div>
          <span class="how-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section class="options" id="options">
      <div class="pill"><i></i> Built around your day</div>
      <h2>A delivery option for every kind of send</h2>
      <div class="options-line">
        <p>Choose the balance of speed, timing and price that works for you. These sample quotes are for Brixton to Camden.</p>
        <a class="options-cta" href="#hero">Quote my parcel <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7.5 12 3l9 4.5-9 4.5L3 7.5Z"/><path d="M3 7.5V16.5L12 21l9-4.5V7.5"/><path d="M12 12v9"/></svg></a>
      </div>
