    </section>
    <section class="faq" id="faq">
      <div class="faq-intro">
        <div class="pill"><i></i> Good to know</div>
        <h2>Questions, answered clearly</h2>
        <p>The essentials before you send, book or choose a provider.</p>
        <div class="faq-help">
          <span class="faq-help-icon"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12Z"/></svg></span>
          <h3>Still wondering?</h3>
          <p>Our support team is here daily, 8am–8pm.</p>
          <div class="faq-contact">
            <a href="mailto:<%= site.supportEmail %>" aria-label="Email <%= site.supportEmail %>">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 7 9 6 9-6"/></svg>
              Email
            </a>
            <a class="is-whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/<%= site.phone %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="WhatsApp <%= site.phoneDisplay %>">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2Zm0 18.2a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-4.2-1.2l-.3-.2-3 .8.8-2.9-.2-.3A8.2 8.2 0 1 1 12 20.2Zm4.5-6.1c-.2-.1-1.5-.7-1.7-.8-.2-.1-.4-.1-.6.1l-.8 1c-.1.2-.3.2-.5.1a6.7 6.7 0 0 1-3.3-2.9c-.3-.4.2-.4.7-1.4.1-.2 0-.3 0-.4l-.8-1.8c-.2-.5-.4-.4-.6-.4h-.5a1 1 0 0 0-.7.3 3 3 0 0 0-.9 2.2 5.2 5.2 0 0 0 1.1 2.8 11.9 11.9 0 0 0 4.6 4c1.7.7 2.3.8 3.2.7a2.7 2.7 0 0 0 1.8-1.3 2.2 2.2 0 0 0 .2-1.3c-.1-.1-.2-.2-.5-.3Z"/></svg>
              WhatsApp
            </a>
            <a href="tel:+<%= site.phone %>" aria-label="Call <%= site.phoneDisplay %>">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z"/></svg>
              Call
            </a>
          </div>
          <p class="faq-number"><%= site.phoneDisplay %> · <%= site.supportEmail %></p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details name="faq" open>
          <summary>Do I need an account to get a quote?<span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>No. Enter your route or service details and compare available providers straight away. You only share contact details with the provider you choose.</p>
        </details>
        <details name="faq">
          <summary>How are providers checked?<span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>Every provider confirms their identity, contact details and right to work before they appear. Reviews can only be left by customers who completed a booking.</p>
        </details>
        <details name="faq">
          <summary>What can I send with Ajobzio?<span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>Documents, parcels, gifts, groceries and bulky items, from a small envelope to furniture. Illegal, hazardous or perishable items that need special handling can’t be sent.</p>
        </details>
        <details name="faq">
          <summary>When and how do I pay?<span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>You see the full price before you book. Pay the provider directly once your booking is confirmed, using the payment options they accept.</p>
        </details>
        <details name="faq">
          <summary>What if my plans change?<span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>Contact your provider as early as you can to reschedule or cancel. If something goes wrong, our support team can help sort it out.</p>
        </details>
        <details name="faq">
          <summary>Is my parcel protected?<span class="faq-toggle" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary>
          <p>Eligible deliveries include basic protection from pickup to handoff. For higher-value items, ask your provider about extra cover before you book.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="cta" id="get-started">
      <svg class="cta-lines" viewBox="0 0 1440 460" preserveAspectRatio="none" fill="none" stroke="rgba(8,123,105,0.16)" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M0 280C180 200 300 150 480 190s260 160 470 110 300-170 490-260"/>
        <path d="M1100 0c40 90 140 140 340 120"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="cta-eyebrow">Ready when you are</div>
      <h2>What needs doing today?</h2>
      <p class="cta-sub">Get local options and clear prices in under a minute. No account, no obligation.</p>
      <form class="cta-form" id="ctaForm">
        <label class="cta-field">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1666D8" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
          <span><small>Search</small><input id="ctaNeed" list="serviceList" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Courier, moving help, cleaning..."></span>
        </label>
        <label class="cta-field">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1666D8" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-12a7 7 0 0 1 14 0c0 5.8-7 12-7 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/></svg>
          <span><small>Near</small><input id="ctaArea" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Enter your area or locality"></span>
        </label>
        <button type="submit" class="cta-submit">Find help <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></button>
      </form>
      <div class="cta-popular">
        Popular:
        <button type="button">Same-day courier</button>
        <button type="button">Man with a van</button>
        <button type="button">Cleaner today</button>
        <button type="button">Furniture assembly</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <dialog class="contact-dialog" id="contactDialog" aria-labelledby="contactTitle">
    <form id="contactForm" novalidate>
      <h2 id="contactTitle">Confirm your quote</h2>
      <p class="contact-sub">Tell us how to reach you and our team will get back with your quote.</p>
      <ul class="contact-summary" id="contactSummary"></ul>
      <div class="contact-fields">
        <input class="contact-trap" name="website" id="contactWebsite" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true">
        <label class="field">
          <span><span>Full name</span><input id="contactName" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></span>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span><span>Phone number</span><input id="contactPhone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" required></span>
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span><span>Email (optional)</span><input id="contactEmail" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email"></span>
        </label>
      </div>
      <p class="parcel-note contact-status" id="contactStatus" role="status" hidden></p>
      <div class="contact-actions">
        <button type="button" class="compare ghost" id="contactCancel">Cancel</button>
        <button type="submit" class="compare" id="contactSubmit">Confirm Quote</button>
      </div>
      <button type="button" class="contact-whatsapp" id="contactWhatsapp">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2Zm0 18.2a8.2 8.2 0 0 1-4.2-1.2l-.3-.2-3 .8.8-2.9-.2-.3A8.2 8.2 0 1 1 12 20.2Zm4.5-6.1c-.2-.1-1.5-.7-1.7-.8-.2-.1-.4-.1-.6.1l-.8 1c-.1.2-.3.2-.5.1a6.7 6.7 0 0 1-3.3-2.9c-.3-.4.2-.4.7-1.4.1-.2 0-.3 0-.4l-.8-1.8c-.2-.5-.4-.4-.6-.4h-.5a1 1 0 0 0-.7.3 3 3 0 0 0-.9 2.2 5.2 5.2 0 0 0 1.1 2.8 11.9 11.9 0 0 0 4.6 4c1.7.7 2.3.8 3.2.7a2.7 2.7 0 0 0 1.8-1.3 2.2 2.2 0 0 0 .2-1.3c-.1-.1-.2-.2-.5-.3Z"/></svg>
        Or send this quote on WhatsApp
      </button>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <dialog class="contact-dialog map-dialog" id="mapDialog" aria-labelledby="mapTitle">
    <h2 id="mapTitle">Choose on map</h2>
    <p class="contact-sub">Search your locality, then move the map so the pin sits on the exact spot.</p>
    <label class="field map-search">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#1666D8" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"/></svg>
      <span><span>Search locality</span><input id="mapSearch" placeholder="Search a locality or landmark"></span>
    </label>
    <div class="map-wrap">
      <div class="map-canvas" id="mapCanvas"></div>
      <svg class="map-pin" width="36" height="44" viewBox="0 0 36 44" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 43s15-13.2 15-25A15 15 0 0 0 3 18c0 11.8 15 25 15 25Z" fill="#1666D8" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2"/><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="5.5" fill="#fff"/></svg>
      <button type="button" class="map-locate" id="mapLocate">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3"/></svg>
        Use my current location
      </button>
    </div>
    <p class="parcel-note contact-status" id="mapStatus" role="status" hidden></p>
    <div class="contact-actions">
      <button type="button" class="compare ghost" id="mapCancel">Cancel</button>
      <button type="button" class="compare" id="mapConfirm">Confirm location</button>
    </div>
  </dialog>

<%- include("../partials/footer") %>
